    "start_html": "<div id=\"designModeViz\" class=\"appModern\" style=\"display: none; width: 320px; height: 450px;\"><div class=\"screen\" tabindex=\"1\" data-theme=\"default\" id=\"compressScreen\" style=\"display: block; height: 450px; width: 320px; left: 0px; top: 0px; position: absolute; z-index: 0; background-color: rgb(27, 137, 247);\"><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); color: rgb(255, 164, 0); font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 320px; height: 26px; position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 410px; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"compressedLabel\">Compressed:</label><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); color: rgb(255, 164, 0); font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 320px; height: 28px; position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 385px; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"originalLabel\">Original:</label><input type=\"range\" value=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" id=\"bitsSlider\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: 310px; height: 25px; position: absolute; left: 5px; top: 250px;\"><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 190px; height: 20px; position: absolute; left: 130px; top: 360px; text-align: left; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"sampleSizeOutput\"></label><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 320px; height: 45px; position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 280px; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"label1\">Move the slider to create a lossy compression of the image above. </label><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); color: rgb(255, 164, 0); font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 142px; height: 21px; position: absolute; top: 360px; text-align: center; left: 0px; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"label2\">Sample Size: </label><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 190px; height: 20px; position: absolute; left: 130px; top: 385px; text-align: left; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"originalOutput\"></label><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 190px; height: 20px; position: absolute; left: 130px; top: 410px; text-align: left; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"compressedOutput\"></label><label style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 1; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; max-width: 320px; border-style: solid; color: rgb(77, 87, 95); background-color: rgb(255, 164, 0); border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); border-radius: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; padding: 2px 15px; width: 320px; height: 25px; position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 210px; text-rendering: optimizespeed;\" id=\"label7\"></label><button id=\"newImageButton\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-style: solid; height: 30px; width: 100px; background-color: rgb(255, 164, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-color: rgb(77, 87, 95); border-radius: 4px; border-width: 1px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; position: absolute; left: 110px; top: 320px;\">New Image</button><img src=\"https://sustainabledevelopment.un.org/content/images/image18_708.jpg\" data-canonical-image-url=\"https://sustainabledevelopment.un.org/content/images/image18_708.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"contain\" id=\"waitingImage\" style=\"height: 75px; width: 205px; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; position: absolute; left: 105px; top: 360px; margin: 0px;\" class=\"design-mode-hidden\" data-image-type=\"url\"></div></div>",
    "fail_on_lint_errors": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Do This\r\n\r\n1. Run the program by clicking the orange **Run** button.\r\n\r\n2. Choose an image to explore.\r\n\r\n    * Click **New Image** and paste an image URL.\r\n    * **Important:** The image URL must come from one of these approved websites:\r\n\r\n      * `picsum.photos`\r\n      * `upload.wikimedia.org`\r\n      * `images.code.org`\r\n        \r\n      * any `*.code.org` website\r\n    * You can usually copy an image URL by right-clicking an image and selecting **Copy Image Address**.\r\n* Experiment with different compression levels to find the **highest compression** (fewest bytes) where your image is still recognizable.\r\n* Show your compressed image to a friend and see if they can guess what it is!\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**If your image doesn't load...**\r\n\r\nTry using an image from one of the approved websites listed above. Images from other websites may not work.\r\n",
